<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(e) </span>Amazon (4B)</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
