<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(f) </span>Emotion (4B)</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 5: </span>Variations in accuracy reward values on the SST-5, Amazon, and Emotion datasets during GTA and GRPO fine-tuning </figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S5.F6" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="S5.F6.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.12108v1/more_sst5_3b-eps-converted-to.svg" id="S5.F6.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/318;" width="476" height="318"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>SST-5 (3B) Accuracy Reward</figcaption>
